1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,270
Why it scores: the thesis concedes something before it argues.

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:08,736
Every paragraph earns its topic sentence with a concrete case.

3
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:11,979
The other side is given properly, then answered.

4
00:00:11,979 --> 00:00:16,705
The conclusion proposes a remedy instead of repeating paragraph one.

5
00:00:16,705 --> 00:00:20,117
And the sentences vary from three words to thirty.

